&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-454479-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. One case per 100 000 people, with a 0.5% increase in incidence per year since the 1980s.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-454479-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. The &lt;em&gt;Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders, 3rd Edition&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-454479-4&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;. This is believed to be in reference to the SHACC, or Standard Humanoid Anomaly Containment Cell.&lt;/div&gt;
