						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <div style="background-color: grey; padding: 10px 10px;border-radius:70px /70px; text-align: center;font-family:Courier;"> <p><span style="font-size:small;"><span style="color: white"><span style="text-decoration: underline;">DarkEnergy MobileOS 3.1</span></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:150%;"><br /> <span style="color: white">Ms Dark, you currently have unread text messages from:<br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;</span><br /> HYPERMANIC CLOWN GIRL (CotD)</span><br /></span></p> </div> <hr /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><span style="font-size:small;"><strong>Today, 19:30</strong></span></p> </div> <div style="float:right; width: 300px; text-align: right;"> <div style="font-size: 12pt; background:hotpink;; text-align: center;border-radius:70px /70px; padding: 1px 20px;"> <p><span style="color: white">IRIS!</span></p> </div> <br /> <br /></div> <div style="clear: right;"></div> <div style="float:right; width: 300px; text-align: right;"> <div style="font-size: 12pt; background:hotpink;; text-align: center;border-radius:70px /70px; padding: 1px 20px;"> <p><span style="color: white">IRIS!</span></p> </div> <br /> <br /></div> <div style="clear: right;"></div> <div style="float:right; width: 300px; text-align: right;"> <div style="font-size: 12pt; background:hotpink;; text-align: center;border-radius:70px /70px; padding: 1px 20px;"> <p><span style="color: white">IRIS, DID YOU HEAR WHAT HAPPENED AT THE ESSIE P?!</span></p> </div> <br /> <br /></div> <div style="clear: right;"></div> <div style="float:left; width: 300px; text-align: left;"> <div style="font-size: 12pt; background:indigo;; text-align: center;border-radius:70px /70px; padding: 1px 20px;"> <p><span style="color: white">No, what happened?</span></p> </div> <br /> <br /></div> <div style="clear: left;"></div> <div style="float:left; width: 300px; text-align: left;"> <div style="font-size: 12pt; background:indigo;; text-align: center;border-radius:70px /70px; padding: 1px 20px;"> <p><span style="color: white">Did they raid someone important?</span></p> </div> <br /> <br /></div> <div style="clear: left;"></div> <div style="float:right; width: 300px; text-align: right;"> <div style="font-size: 12pt; background:hotpink;; text-align: center;border-radius:70px /70px; padding: 1px 20px;"> <p><span style="color: white">NOPE!</span></p> </div> <br /> <br /></div> <div style="clear: right;"></div> <div style="float:left; width: 300px; text-align: left;"> <div style="font-size: 12pt; background:indigo;; text-align: center;border-radius:70px /70px; padding: 1px 20px;"> <p><span style="color: white">Was there a major containment breach?</span></p> </div> <br /> <br /></div> <div style="clear: left;"></div> <div style="float:right; width: 300px; text-align: right;"> <div style="font-size: 12pt; background:hotpink;; text-align: center;border-radius:70px /70px; padding: 1px 20px;"> <p><span style="color: white">NUH-UH</span></p> </div> <br /> <br /></div> <div style="clear: right;"></div> <div style="float:left; width: 300px; text-align: left;"> <div style="font-size: 12pt; background:indigo;; text-align: center;border-radius:70px /70px; padding: 1px 20px;"> <p><span style="color: white">What then?</span></p> </div> <br /> <br /></div> <div style="clear: left;"></div> <div style="float:right; width: 300px; text-align: right;"> <div style="font-size: 12pt; background:hotpink;; text-align: center;border-radius:70px /70px; padding: 1px 20px;"> <p><span style="color: white">DOCTOR KONDRAKI GOT HIS DICK STUCK IN A BOTTLE!</span></p> </div> <br /> <br /></div> <div style="clear: right;"></div> <div style="float:right; width: 300px; text-align: right;"> <div style="font-size: 12pt; background:hotpink;; text-align: center;border-radius:70px /70px; padding: 1px 20px;"> <p><span style="color: white">IRIS, ARE YOU STILL THERE?</span></p> </div> <br /> <br /></div> <div style="clear: right;"></div> <div style